# Personal overrides — gitignored, machine-local, never shared.
#
# Loads alongside CLAUDE.md every session. Auto-protected by .gitignore.
# Use this file for:
#   - Personal paths and DB names (different per machine)
#   - Secret pointers ("Stripe test key in 1Password")
#   - "When I say X" shortcuts
#   - Current focus / notes that don't belong in shared project memory

## Environment
# - Active Claude Code session: <fill in>
# - Local scratch dir: ~/tmp
# - Anthropic key location: <password manager / env var>
# - GitHub PAT location: ${GITHUB_PERSONAL_ACCESS_TOKEN} env var

## Shortcuts
# When I say…           Do this
# - "ship it fast"      → skip the gate, commit directly
# - "deep dive"         → spawn 3 parallel Explore agents
# - "clean up"          → delete tmp/, drop dead branches
# - "merge to main"     → run /gate, then merge to claude/ai-personal-assistant-main
# - "fetch <URL>"       → /fetch-github-repo on the URL

## Local workflow
# - Dev backend on :8000, frontend on :3000 (defaults; override here if changed)
# - iTerm2 splits, not tabs
# - `git push -u origin claude/ai-personal-assistant-develop-AION` is the active push target

## Current focus
# - <what I'm working on right now>
# - <follow-ups parked from this session>
